Write a method named `celsiusToFahrenheit` that takes a `double` parameter `celsius` representing a temperature in Celsius and returns the equivalent temperature in Fahrenheit as a `double`. Use the formula `F = C * 9/5 + 32`.

Complete the method below.

```java
public double celsiusToFahrenheit(double celsius) {
    /* your code here */
}
```

sampleResponse:
```java
public double celsiusToFahrenheit(double celsius) {
    double fahrenheit = celsius * 9.0 / 5.0 + 32;
    return fahrenheit;
}
```
